.DS_Store

# Work Loop v2 per-checkout ownership declaration (R2, "the checkout declares its writer"): one task
# id + claim date, written by whoever creates the task's state file, cleared at closure. It MUST stay
# checkout-local — a committed copy would replicate across worktrees on merge and then declare every
# checkout the owner, which is the exact failure the declaration exists to refuse. Read/written by
# logs/scripts/work-loop-owner.sh; see ai-resources/docs/parallel-sessions-playbook.md § 4.
logs/work-loop/.owner
